it feels really good.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.790
- Your different worlds
are coming together.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.230
- The different worlds are coming together

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.150
and you know, as a songwriter too

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:26.790
to me it's one of the
most satisfying things.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.170
- Yeah.
- It's their part of me

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:31.320
that I feel like I can use my metaphorical

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.030
