00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.361
- It's really literal exactly like...

00:04:39.361 --> 00:04:40.194
- And you just say, yeah,

00:04:40.194 --> 00:04:42.781
just what if you were
in this relationship?

00:04:42.781 --> 00:04:44.130
- Yeah, exactly, what if?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.360
Like actors do.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:47.520
- I don't know but like
someone out there might know.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.370
- Yes, exactly.
- So Brian, have you ever

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.203
