00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:16.920
And I said, no, why?

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.780
And he goes, well, because I need to write

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:21.330
down every second of music on a show

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:22.980
and you're whistling and humming.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:23.970
- That's true.
- Unless you're whistling

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.380
and humming someone else's work,

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.231
And I went, how dare you.

00:05:27.231 --> 00:05:28.290
(laughing)

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:30.960
- This is my original.
- Original.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:34.020
And so to this day I will get a cheque,

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:37.380
it said, Hal humming, two seconds.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.750
Hal whistling second and a half.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.640
- Oh my gosh.
- So it got to a point

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.560
