these little cheques

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.640
and I would cash them

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:47.820
and buy drinks for all the crew.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.470
- Oh that's so great.
- Oh I love that.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:52.800
- And sometimes a crew
member would come by and say,

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.770
