Chicago, the band Chicago.

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:20.580
- Oh my gosh.
- You were fantastic.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:23.427
In 54 Below, I've seen you.
- That's right.

00:06:23.427 --> 00:06:26.670
- And in other places
and you're marvelous.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.503
