00:06:47.719 --> 00:06:49.020
(whistling)
I just was thinking that

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:49.853
when you were whistling.

00:06:49.853 --> 00:06:50.970
I was like, that's hysterical.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.470
- There he goes.
- That's literally opening up

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.550
my album, Possibly.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.500
But anyway, your your new album

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.480
is called Rita Wilson
Now and Forever Duets.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.580
