- Yes.

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.940
It's all cover songs from the seventies.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:07.080
And sort of re-envisioned as
conversations and duets, right?

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:09.240
Because I was thinking,
what if these songs were

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.280
actually conversations that people were,

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.020
lovers were having with each other.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.400
- Yeah.
- So I get to sing

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.500
with amazing people like Smokey Robinson,

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:19.313
Willie Nelson, Keith
Urban, Leslie Odom Jr.

00:07:19.313 --> 00:07:20.146
- Gosh Groban, that's a lot of people.

00:07:20.146 --> 00:07:22.110
I mean yeah, Elvis Costello.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.120
- Yeah.
- So it's very...

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.040
- What's it like asking, like,
you know what I'm saying?

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.682
