00:07:28.682 --> 00:07:30.210
- Nerve wrecking.
- Yeah 'cause

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:33.030
it doesn't matter, like
how how many award,

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.340
whatever you do, you're
still very nervous about like

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:36.750
or you could just say, no,
it's a dumb idea, right?

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.130
I don't know (mumbles).

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:39.480
I like literally preface it.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.790
- Exactly, like I give
them the out right away.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.710
Like, I mean, maybe you
would wanna do this seriously

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:44.670
but it's okay if you don't want to.

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:46.620
As a matter of fact I'm
hanging up right now,

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.660
because what's the point?

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.190
- I just don't wanna hear the no,

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.200
but I know that I might hear a no.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.500
But in this case, very
lucky, very, very humbled

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.450
by everybody who was able to show up.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.070
- That's awesome.
- It's really great.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:03.600
My co-producer Matt Rawlings
is an amazing producer

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:05.340
and he had worked with Willie Nelson

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:08.130
on Willie Nelson's Gershen
and Sinatra albums.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:11.400
