00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:29.010
- Contact high, contact high.

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:30.870
No, I did not hang out on his bus,

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:35.160
but this year he sent
me hemp tea and coffee.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.860
That he's got his own hemp tea and coffee.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.810
He and his wife Annie
sent that for Christmas.

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:40.680
- You know, he's a connoisseur,

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:42.180
so I would trust his product.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:44.070
- Yeah, it's good for the muscles.

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:47.993
- Yeah it is.
(laughing)

